              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ٹھہرنا — ṭhaharnā — \"to stay, to wait\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ٹھہرنا (ṭhaharnā) is a tadbhava, a word inherited and reshaped by sound change. It comes from stabhira, \"fixed, firm\", a form CDIAL reconstructs from its descendants (CDIAL 13680). It is built on stambh-, \"to make firm\"."
            }
          ]
        },
